{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320918001:0":{"text":"ちょうどいいところに。あんたたちが探してた子だろ？早く連れて帰ってくれよ。","source_cn":"你们来得正好。这就是你们要找的那孩子吧？赶紧带他回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC7ABFA00B4A2FC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320918002:0":{"text":"幽霊のおばさんを見つけるまでは帰らないよ！ぜったい墓地のどこかにいるんだから！","source_cn":"我不走，我要找幽灵大婶！她肯定就在墓园里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E103F87FAAF30BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320918003:1":{"text":"ウソはやめなさい！俺は一晩中ここにいたけど、幽霊なんて見なかったぞ！","source_cn":"别胡说！我在墓园里守了一晚上，压根没见着什么幽灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EE6CC15211A354D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320918004:0":{"text":"ウソじゃない！それに、メイジの<male>お兄さん</male><female>お姉さん</female>も見てるんだからね！","source_cn":"我没胡说！这里就是有幽灵，魔法师<male>哥哥</m...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF8C8ADF676CDC3FD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ウソじゃない！それに、メイジの<male>お兄さん</male><female>お姉さん</female>も見てるんだからね！","female":"ウソじゃない！それに、メイジの<male>お兄さん</male><female>お姉さん</female>も見てるんだからね！","variant_male_record_index":"148124","variant_female_record_index":"148125","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320918005:0":{"text":"……本当なのか？","source_cn":"……真有幽灵？","status":"matched"